0\"> Double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  zoom</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NativeProps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ViewProps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  latitude</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  longitude</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  zoomLevel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  onRegionChange</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DirectEventHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RegionChangeEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> codegenNativeComponent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NativeProps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RNMapView'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件类型</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n<th>传播方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>DirectEventHandler</code></td>\n<td>只在目标组件处理的事件（如 <code>onRegionChange</code>）</td>\n<td>不冒泡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>BubblingEventHandler</code></td>\n<td>需要冒泡到父组件的事件（如 <code>onPress</code>）</td>\n<td>向上冒泡</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>TurboModules 和 Fabric 共同构成了新架构下原生集成的两条轨道：TurboModules 负责命令式 API（&quot;调用原生能力&quot;），Fabric 负责声明式 UI（&quot;把原生控件放到 React 树中&quot;）。两者的开发流程都遵循&quot;TypeScript Spec → Codegen → 原生实现&quot;的三步范式，将接口不匹配从运行时错误提前为编译时错误。</p>\n<p>实践中需要注意 Spec 文件的格式约束（不支持联合类型、泛型、可选方法），以及同步方法的使用场景——同步调用在 JS 线程阻塞原生执行，只适合执行时间确定在微秒级的操作（如读取设备信息），不应用于 I/O 或耗时计算。</p>\n<p>对于平台特定代码的组织策略，参见 <a href=\"platform-specific-code\">平台特定代码策略</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Turbo Modules 与 Fabric：新架构原生集成规范","id":"turbo-modules-与-fabric-新架构原生集成规范"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"TurboModule：完整实现流程","id":"turbomodule-完整实现流程"},{"level":3,"text":"第一步：编写 TypeScript Spec","id":"第一步-编写-typescript-spec"},{"level":3,"text":"第二步：配置 Codegen","id":"第二步-配置-codegen"},{"level":3,"text":"第三步：iOS 实现（Swift）","id":"第三步-ios-实现-swift"},{"level":3,"text":"第四步：Android 实现（Kotlin）","id":"第四步-android-实现-kotlin"},{"level":2,"text":"Fabric 原生组件：UI 层集成","id":"fabric-原生组件-ui-层集成"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"React Native 原生模块开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/react-native-development/native-integration/native-modules"},"next":{"title":"React Native 平台特定代码策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/react-native-development/native-integration/platform-specific-code"}}